,"source_id":"s-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi-ws1996694","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002","quote":"准之兼明禮傳，贍於文辭。起家為本國右常侍，桓玄大將軍行參軍。玄篡位，以為尚書祠部郎。義熙初，又為尚書中兵郎，遷參高祖車騎中軍軍事，丹陽丞，中軍太尉主簿，出為山陰令，有能名。預討盧循功，封都亭侯。又為高祖鎮西、平北、太尉參軍，尚書左丞，本郡大中正。宋臺建，除御史中丞，為僚友所憚。准之父訥之、祖臨之、曾祖彪之至准之，四世居此職。准之嘗作五言，范泰謿之曰：「卿唯解彈事耳。」准之正色答：「猶差卿世載雄狐。」坐世子右衞率謝靈運殺人不舉免官。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0142"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本句所載官名，任期無確切年月。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[{"older_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBBBA","younger_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBBBB","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null,"assertion_id":"a-nanshi024-wangqunzhi-guizhi-nazhi","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBBBB","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi:p001","quote":"訥之弟瑰之字道茂，位司空諮議參軍。瑰之子逡之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi:p001:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi:p001:m0000","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi:p001","surface":"訥之弟瑰之","start":0,"end":5}}]}],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[{"older_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBBBA","younger_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBBBB","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null,"assertion_id":"a-nanshi024-wangqunzhi-guizhi-nazhi","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBBBB","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi:p001","quote":"訥之弟瑰之字道茂，位司空諮議參軍。瑰之子逡之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi:p001:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqunzhi:p001:m0000","relationship_anchor":{"para